      "content": "i guess. it just feels more than being a spectator. it feels like i've seen the bottom of things, you know? like i've been somewhere real and now im back in this dream world where nothing matters. i don't think i can ever actually be one of them again. it's like i've already left, even though i'm still standing here.",
